{{Quote|Send all troops in Sector Twelve to the South Slope to protect the fighters!|[[Leia Skywalker Organa Solo|Leia Organa]]|<ref name="Episode V">{{Film|V}}</ref>}}
The '''South Ridge''',<ref name="Ultimate" /> or '''South Slope''',<ref name="Episode V" /> was an area on the [[Clabburn Range]] of the frozen [[planet]] of [[Hoth]]. It was located immediately to the south of [[Echo Base]], a hidden base built by the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebel Alliance]] in the aftermath of the [[Battle of Yavin]]. When the [[Galactic Empire]] [[Battle of Hoth|attacked]] Echo Base, the South Ridge was used as a [[staging area]] for evacuating the Rebel [[transport]]s and the [[starfighter]]s that were to escort them past the Imperial [[blockade]] of the [[Hoth system|system]].<ref name="Ultimate" />

